1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
Do you know why people shouldn't be idle?

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:05,000
Because when the land is idle, weeds grow.

3
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:08,000
When people are idle, worries grow.

4
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:12,000
Idleness brings trouble, boredom, and restlessness.

5
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:14,000
You'll notice that when you're too idle,

6
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:17,000
life starts to feel especially hard.

7
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:20,000
You become aimless, your thoughts wander.

8
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:22,000
You feel anxious and unsettled.

9
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:26,000
And you try to distract yourself by changing tasks or environments.

10
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:28,000
Romaine Raland once said,

11
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:31,000
The heaviest burden in life is not hardship,

12
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:33,000
but having no purpose.

13
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:37,000
The cruelest way to ruin a person is to let them keep thinking endlessly

14
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:40,000
in a comfortable, unchallenging environment.

15
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:43,000
In that state, people lose their fighting spirit.

16
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:45,000
So start something new.

17
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:48,000
Get busy, stay active, be determined,

18
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:51,000
don't let yourself fall into idleness.

19
00:00:51,000 --> 00:00:54,000
When people are idle, they overthink.

20
00:00:54,000 --> 00:00:56,000
When they're lazy, they become stagnant.

21
00:00:56,000 --> 00:00:59,000
When they have no goals, they fall apart.

22
00:00:59,000 --> 00:01:01,000
But when your life is filled with work,

23
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:05,000
exercise, reading, gatherings, and meaningful things,

24
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:08,000
congratulations, you're on the right path.

25
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:11,000
Better things and brighter days are waiting ahead.

